terminal COMPLETE COMPLETE "Recovery and boundary handling are explicit."
terminal HARD-STOP-SCOPE HARD_STOP "The changed condition requires a new goal or authority."
terminal HARD-STOP-EVIDENCE HARD_STOP "Failure classification is not evidenced."
terminal SOFT-REVIEW SOFT_REVIEW "The Campaign Orchestrator must review the recovery route."
terminal UNPROVEN UNPROVEN "Recovery behavior is not established."
